{"id":"o-audrainautomuseum-org","claimKey":"1fbc2facf6eebfbd6b7b253423cd862ea2a959288f234800d3a70cc0e2cb221b","title":"Audrain Auto Museum","cat":"play","art":"museum","area":"Newport, RI","metroId":"cape-cod","src":"audrainautomuseum.org","specs":[],"options":[{"name":"Past Exhibitions","detail":"Children (6-17)","price":8},{"name":"Tickets","detail":"Children (6-17)","price":8},{"name":"Land Yachts","detail":"Children (6-17)","price":8},{"name":"Tables","detail":"Children (6-17)","price":8},{"name":"Past Exhibitions","detail":"Adults","price":18},{"name":"Tickets","detail":"Adults","price":18},{"name":"Land Yachts","detail":"Adults","price":18},{"name":"Tables","detail":"Adults","price":18},{"name":"Membership","detail":"Standard","price":150},{"name":"Tables","detail":"Single Ticket","price":250},{"name":"Program Acknowledgements","detail":"","price":1500,"per":"/group"},{"name":"Tables","detail":"Sapphire Table","price":5000,"per":"/group"},{"name":"1981 Porsche 936 Junior Kart","detail":"","price":null},{"name":"1985 Jeep CJ7","detail":"","price":null},{"name":"1950s Chris Craft Kiddie Boat Ride","detail":"","price":null},{"name":"Scrambler & Dirt Bikes","detail":"","price":null}],"services":[{"name":"Past Exhibitions","desc":"Today’s world of the concours grew out of the French tradition of displaying the most up to date coach-built automobiles built in the early 20th century. Manufacturers and wealthy owners would present their cars as expressions of fashion, technology and status. A Concours d’Elegance today is a celebration of exceptional automobiles, where beautifully preserved, restored, and historically significant cars are presented and compete for awards. Cars are displayed in carefully curated classes and judges evaluate them according to criteria such as design & beauty, styling, authenticity, provenance and historical significance. As the Audrain’s mission statement conveys ─ “Preserving, Celebrating,","photo":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/con